Column name: app_info Type: STRUCT<id STRING, version STRING, install_store STRING, firebase_app_id STRING, install_source STRING> Description: The privacy_info fields contain information based on the consent status of a user when consent mode is enabled.
Column name: traffic_source Type: STRUCT<medium STRING, name STRING, source STRING> Description: Whether Analytics storage is enabled for the user. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: stream_id Type: INT64 Description: Whether ad targeting is enabled for a user. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: platform Type: STRING Description: Whether a web user has denied Analytics storage and the developer has enabled measurement without cookies based on transient tokens in server data. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: event_dimensions Type: STRUCT<hostname STRING> Description: The user_properties RECORD contains any user properties that you have set. It is repeated for each key that is associated with a user.
